-- TRIEL example inside the formal core: composite terms with two actions in
-- sequence. An action is the event of a later entry, so two obligations in
-- sequence need two actions, and a prohibition inside a composite term is
-- violated by its first forbidden action (errata 2.5.1). Every construct in
-- this file is translated into the Isabelle/HOL core (formal/core) and
-- evaluated by the exported evaluator (evaluator/).

SPECIFICATION core_sequence VERSION 1.0.0

SUBJECTS {
  alice : PARTY,
  bob   : PARTY
}

TERMS {
  alice MUST pay THEN bob MUST_NOT leak;
  alice MUST pay THEN alice MUST pay
}
